{title: 024 - Every Star Shall Sing a Carol}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #024 • EVERY STAR • 9.8.8.7}
{lyricist: Sydney Carter}
{composer: Sydney Carter}
{key: Bb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 24}
{meta: tune EVERY STAR}
{meta: meter 9.8.8.7}
{meta: category Worship - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Gm]Every [Adim]star [Cm/G]shall [Bb/F]sing [Dm]acarol;
[Bb]Every [Gm]creature, [Bb/F]high [Cm]or low,
[Dm/A]Come [Gm]and [Bb/F]praise the [Dm]King [Cm]of [Dm]heaven
[Bb]By whatever [Gm]name you [Dm]know.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[Gm]God above, Man [Dm]below,
[Gm]Holy [Dm]is [Adim]the [Bb]name [F]I know.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Gm]When the [Cm]King of [Bb/F]all [Cm]creation
[Bb]Had [F]a cradle on [Bb/F]the [Cm]earth,
[Dm/A]Holy [Bb/F]was the [Dm]human body,
[Bb]Holy [Dm/A]was [Gm]the human [Dm]birth.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Gm]Every [Cm]star and [Bb/F]every [Dm]planet,
[Bb]Every [Gm]creature, [Bb/F]high [Cm]or low,
[Dm/A]Come [Gm]and [Bb/F]praise the [Dm]King [Cm]of [Dm]heaven
[Bb]By whatever [Gm]name you [Dm]know.
{end_of_verse}
